{"id":316,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年6月12日下午，机电工程学院在科艺苑隆重举行2026届毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式。中北大学党委常委、副校长尹建平、机电工程学院党委书记赵河明、院长李强、 副院长李世中，各专业负责人、教授代表、各科室负责人、2026届毕业班班主任、全体辅导员及2026届全体毕业生参加大会。学院党委副书记田海燕主持仪式。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMmUe4M8L8oRlany7UZLNVVnzV2UmVh2L7V7LRNZLlLZLN70gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7MSyDokyPU4UbM7VkMm9PUlUYLmUPozUbol7DM7nRoz6FLRQVM8V7nmAFMR-ZM7CJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ED5681C494AB681AD22419499A64DC97/06E7ADF8/4284F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMlneVUlUaLNnfMyzGsnR98Mm9YnNLhiLzVVU4lDU8rVMzG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaLYhknkyYLN7anlUsLzlbM4GDnR-8Mm7inNMRUmW2MNrFMl-DLmCiU4nFnlUaLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>毕业典礼在庄严的国歌声中拉开序幕。院长李强发表致辞，他回顾了2026届毕业生在校期间的成长与收获，肯定了同学们在学业、科创、升学就业等方面取得的优异成绩，并以“坚守兵工初心，胸怀家国立大志；坚守知行合一，深耕实干成大才；坚守坚韧笃行，勇担使命堪大任；坚守赤诚本心，心怀感恩赴远方”四句临别寄语与全体毕业生共勉，希望大家传承兵工精神，以实干笃行成就人生价值，努力成长为新时代国防军工领域可堪大用、能担重任的中坚力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EL7LeDnmr2UlUZoyRC4LlrkU8lDnN7hbLmGin7MkMzM7M490gihFp2hmCIa0M1yinSyYL1yinNlboRGbM7lYnzffLNVfLmCDLm6RLlW7U8QFnRnkUz6kU4WFM8LPM7CJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/65E225FE98094E2E0A2AA26627C1BDCF/D4BA7BC2/7C14F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"630\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EL7LeDnmr2UlUZoyRC4LlrkU8lDnN7hbLmGin7MkMzM7M490gihFp2hmCIa0M1yinSyYL1yinNlboRGbM7lYnzffLNVfLmCDLm6RLlW7U8QFnRnkUz6kU4WFM8LPM7CJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.png\"></p><p>副院长李世中宣读了《关于拟授予2026届毕业生学位的决定》，向顺利通过审核、即将被授予学位的毕业生们表示祝贺。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ELzUePozGanz9YUy8WkMNL8UllsLNChPnN7bUz9aLRQ7Mmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyiLYh7okyaMlQ7MzWkoz9YMlnfMlU8LzUYLRLsUzG4MNrFnzLPnmGiLlrFL8QVLmvJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E53D805FD52B9825DA5D4142037A036E/E31F051E/3FE27\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EolCeDn77PL8MVLyRGbnRCbLmM2M4GhbMzWfM4-4M8C8MN70gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVoShknky4nNVknR-YLR-YMzM7UlWRLzLsLzVVMmNao7WFnzUYnNlZozrFnRLZLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>毕业班班主任为毕业生送上毕业寄语，祝愿同学们毕业快乐、前程似锦。全体2026届毕业生在李铎同学领誓下庄严宣誓，许下青春誓言。在校生代表胡昊宇为学长学姐送上了浓浓的问候与祝福，愿机电学子接续奋斗，让军工精神代代相传。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EL8-eZL8MkM4V2LyRLPo7nfLlWfL4WhRnNn7nlnkM47bM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZLYyaLYyDo77sMzTRM8liMzf7U4V7L4NZM77PMNrkMmQFMzT2U8V2UlMFMzlYM4lJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F830368A759C7E550DC1D3984A16EB66/59FCAFAC/55275\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMN-eaLz-bMmG8UyzW7LN7anzf2L8lh8MmA2UmWRL4AkUzU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkLkyaL1hfL4G8MzN4MNlaLNLZLRf2Ll-aUzCiLllbM4MFMm74L8lPoRAFLl-aL87igtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ELRQeVLRvbLz-PMymTkMln7olUbo7MhRnzvDM4lPnRTfLm70gihFp2hmCIa0LShVoSh7oSyZU4LbMzAVMmMkUNCsU4vbM7-soRUbUm7DnzTFUznVnz-aU8MFM7-ZUzGJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1E9D98C3958E63BBF7C794B7849B16E9/A4EE20CC/4B8A0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM7We7L8rRnRWfMyR9bnm7bUNUPUmNhZU4N4L7U4UmNDL770gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7okyDLSh7MlM7MRr2MmVVL8CZLz78olQVoRUDnR-sLmnFM7lYLlWRMlQFnzCaLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM87eDU8Q2LmLYMyRNanmV7MNn2olUhiM8MkU8U4oRQRLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2MSyaLYhVMzvin7n7UzL8MlC8UlLDUzrkUzWkMmGPUNMFolUYUl7ZLzfFMRWknRvJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2F503E575DDDA345F4AC6A5BA2B601BC/9D2AA810/42BD7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ELl-esoz78MN7YnylUDoR67L8liLRlhsM4M2L7Q2MmNaMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPn1hfLkhRMz6koz7bL7QfnRNboz67MmWRMR6kolM2UmrFLNUZM8CYLznFn7LaLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>教师代表彭志凌教授发言，他希望同学们练就过硬本领，在智能制造、智能无人系统等领域敢闯敢试、勇攀高峰，用智慧和汗水书写属于机电人的华章。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU4leiLlUZnmr2MymCsoRn2U478Mm-hsnm7PMR-ZM4CbnlU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2LYyPnkyiM7nRoRTVo7nfnm9DU4-aUmQRUNUYnR7bU46Fnm9DM8-4n7nFL4A7nmNJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0F31D54DC89E8DAF86C20B6CBD2D19C7/F867B3DD/38DF9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnzLeYM87ioln2nyNrRoRL8Lm-4L8Vh2Uz-YnmvsnNCZL870gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh7LYh2nShfMz6fo7LDMzLZMmT7Ll7aLlLPMm9DolV7LmVFU4GanmCbUmfFMlM7nmrVgtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>学院党委书记赵河明为同学们送上四点希望：一是坚守家国情怀，把准人生航向；二是坚持脚踏实地，走好前行之路；三是秉持自信自立，勇担时代重任；四是常怀感恩之心，恪守做人本心。他表示，学院永远是同学们最温暖的港湾、最坚实的后盾，欢迎大家常回母校看看，与师长、同窗常联系。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUzLe4MzvYLmlYoy7U4M8MkMzQ2UllhsnmQ2LNC4UzA2LRv0gihFp2hmCIa0USh7LYhVMSyZUmNDUmUZLRWfM8MVMRARLNW7MlMkL4G8UlMFMmWkM4CPUmrFL4QRLl7Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AD3E58B96B4802A7CE48C2BD5CB304AC/62B761B5/36C1A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnN-ePLzlYn7QVoy7rkLz-4LllsLRChaUz7aUmUbnmT7U8C0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysLSyan1hfnmvsnlUsMlUYnzGbol7ao7V2Lmf2Uz74nNWFnRGDUlWVUlQFMmvDnzT2gtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>副校长尹建平寄语全体毕业生，他希望同学们永葆军工底色，厚植家国情怀；坚持笃学砺器，练就过硬本领；勇于开拓创新，矢志奋勇争先，在各行各业绽放光彩，续写中北机电人的精彩篇章。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=En7CesUNL8UNLboyz94M4GiMmf2nmlhbnl7sUNLaUmLaUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0okhRMYy4L1hkM7CPUN7anNV2MmrfUzlZozAfMz7snm-YUlVFL4-snln7LNVFMm9DM8-Jv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8C732B4F1BA0FAF65AA5898A517F22AA/327EDD2A/6867B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoRWe2UmUiLz-iLyl7bUm-PUznRnNLh4UmCsLRMVUNC8MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDUSyYoSybL4G4UmlPUmCYnmvPLR6kUl7PL7lioRQfLlVFUl-iL4UsMzMFLzU8UzNsgjfJQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.png\"></p><p>毕业生代表合唱歌曲《再见》，悠扬的歌声里满是不舍与眷恋，定格青春、互道珍重。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnRfe7UmLiUz-4oyz-aU8Q7nlLYMl-h4nRvYUlW2MllYM4-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyaM1h2okyZnR-ZMzvYLR9YnR-PUlnknRvaUlVVMmv8n7WFMRr2o7V7LRVFL4G8M7lJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C06F88D28572082D21ADBD70AAE674DB/45F8AD01/3044E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU8-eaUzQ2nN7YnyzlYM7QkU8lDMR7hZU4-Pnm94L4T7LRv0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyPoSy8oky8UNL8nmLPM49ZMm-8ozN4LlL8o7WVnmQRnlWFMll8L87bLlQFMzNDMzGigtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随后，各位领导老师为本、硕、博毕业生拨穗正冠，并颁发学位证书，为同学们的大学时光画上圆满句号。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoR9eiLmlDM7n7MyRMVU4NsLzn2nRAh7oRUDo7LPU4UaMNU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyZMkyinkyaL4-4Um7iMNl4oR74MNWfM4l8LRN4L4MfLNQFUlWkMlLPLlMFM7LPL8-Jqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1845D0323B156E38136BA75409333A2F/ABB5C11C/4C13B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU8CebLRLbU4v8nyRlYUz98oR7YMRMh2Uz78LR-Zn7V7UN-0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRUYy8Mkh7ozv4oz98LNliMzUYMzQfUmT7LRNYUlQ2MlWFUz7sMzNPM4nFMNW2Um7PgtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ELNrekU4VfLRA7nyzUbnzlbMR6VL8nh2UzUZM8-inzLYozL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYoShRoSh7oRUaM4NZMzAVU4WVU478olUboR7DL7UZL8MFLR9iMRlDMmQFM7UYM7lJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E29C9D84079858EC2EC149D98160D83C/08545666/4D24E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUmCeZM4QVMllZMym9aUlWfMzC4U8-hPM4GYLN-DLmQ2oRC0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8U1h2L1yiLmlsozVkUlWVLNLanRLPollbLzVfLzC4UNQFnRAkn7rVL4WFMNrkMmnRgtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>典礼在激昂的校歌声中落下帷幕。愿机电学子带着师长的嘱托、同窗的情谊与军工的风骨，扬帆远航、步履不停，在属于自己的赛道上奋勇前行，祝愿全体2026届毕业生前程璀璨、鹏程万里！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUz9eZU4ffnzC8Uy4UZU8MRnRCanRLhsnzN8MNLaLmvsM4-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h7LShkn1yPL4-DUlW7olCZnz-bUlQfLlLsLRUYMmGDL4MFL7LPLzWfnmMFMmrRolUJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FD1BF1326ABD9F8E29AFA1C704260633/0C112AF3/65C9D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnlCeinm74UmG8Ly47ZUm62L8CiMzUhsM4n2olnkUmGYolL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyin1yZU1hkn7M2MlrRnz-ao7lYUm9sMm9iUlLYLR-aMzVFo7UiM49YnznFnmUZLRGagtXaQ4Oeo4x/Q26m_dN0qIbtpYyPLRCDg47bLR98gtA8pU3cc&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg\"></p><p>文：李承杭</p><p>图：李承杭、陶柳杏</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jdgc.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMmUe4M8L8oRlany7UZLNVVnzV2UmVh2L7V7LRNZLlLZLN70gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7MSyDokyPU4UbM7VkMm9PUlUYLmUPozUbol7DM7nRoz6FLRQVM8V7nmAFMR-ZM7CJqjfjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNaoRUJqd3nx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19084&e=.jpg"}